#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""airglass-hid: control the mirrored phone with this computer's mouse and keyboard.

The computer presents itself to the phone as a Bluetooth LE mouse + keyboard (HID over
GATT, through BlueZ's D-Bus API; no root needed). Click inside the mirror window to hand
your mouse and keyboard to the phone; press the release key (Right Ctrl) to take them back.

iPhone: Settings > Accessibility > Touch > AssistiveTouch must be on for the pointer.
Pair once with `airglass pair`, then pick the computer under Settings > Bluetooth.
"""
